WEBVTT

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:35.590
Cruel, yet beautiful, and said 
to possess great intelligence...

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:38.590
The legendary creature, Maka.

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:40.790
In the distant past,

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:45.830
it is said that the Maka and humans 
lived separated by the lake,

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:48.790
acknowledging each other's existences.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.600
A great number of residents 
of Blue Notes Blues

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:59.260
witnessed the golden, glittering body 
as it danced aloft in the night sky.

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:04.420
The people revered the Maka as a god,

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:10.330
and they viewed it as a blessing that 
the Maka existed to protect the land.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.210
Yes...

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:15.590
That was until people's 
hearts were polluted by sin.

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:21.070
Blue Notes Blues

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.390
Polluted by sin?

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.070
Blue Notes Blues...

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.630
So this is where the Maka lived...

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.510
Then it's really true...

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:31.080
Niche, what did you mean by 
you were born 200 years ago?

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.980
20 years ago?

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:34.880
2 years?

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.940
I don't get it...

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.970
But that town is where you were born, right?

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.010
If you remember, then that means 
you were here until recently?

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.240
It was when I was a babe!

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:47.910
A babe?

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:49.250
A baby?

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:52.450
You can remember when you were a baby?

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:55.030
I was a babe... I remember...sort of.

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.480
Do you really remember?

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:01.420
But there might be people 
in town who know you, Niche!

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:02.690
When we reach the town, let's ask...

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:03.390
Lag.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.390
It's best not to say anything about me.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.780
Niche, wait! Niche!

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:15.100
A cave?

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:18.560
Hey, what are you doing there?

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.110
Don't get any closer to the Holy Site!

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.870
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.740
Wait, those clothes...

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:28.070
Yeah... He's a Letter Bee!

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.810
Oh, we're so sorry about before.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.780
You must be freezing!

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:38.170
How wonderful of you to 
come all the way up north!

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:41.840
Please, try some of this 
jumping picopico sashimi!

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.480
Oh, please don't bother yourself with me.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:48.120
I only came here to ask some questions...

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.840
What is it you would like to know?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.380
I am the Mayor, Khari Tonov.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:57.540
I bid you welcome to the Glacial 
Village, Blue Notes Blues.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:00.140
I'm the Letter Bee, Lag Seeing.

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:01.920
And this girl is my din...

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.520
Clawgrab!

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:08.390
Niche! Your claws! Your claws 
are digging into my shoulder!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.290
Is this what you wanted?

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:15.600
No, no... I don't need any crab!

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:21.850
This person saw the man garbed 
in black who you are looking for.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:25.270
Yes. He was with a girl clad all in white.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:27.160
That's him!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.400
Where was he, and what was he doing?

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:32.250
It was the path by the glacial 
lake you were walking on.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.740
He was heading toward the cave beyond there.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:38.210
That big cave...

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.190
Thank you very much!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.450
Let's go, Niche.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.650
Hold it.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:47.280
That cave is the most holy place we have.

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:51.140
Even for someone from the government, 
we cannot allow you to enter.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:53.900
I do not know who that man is,

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:57.890
but if he entered that cave, 
he would surely pay dearly.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:02.400
That cave is the path that 
leads to Blue Notes Scale,

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.780
the underground lake where the Maka resides.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.530
Where the Maka...

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:11.180
Um...

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.390
What is it?

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:17.340
In this book, it talks about "Until 
people's hearts were polluted by sin."

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:19.450
What does that mean?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:26.570
A shortsighted fool from this 
village ate the forbidden fruit.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:27.740
Forbidden?

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:32.980
The Maka was so disheartened 
that it no longer shows itself.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:36.180
It was around 200 years ago...

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.520
Blue Notes Blues was 
facing a terrible crisis.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.840
Our geothermal energy was being taken away.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.320
The few fertile fields fell frozen.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.320
Many townspeople died.

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:53.650
Among those that survived was 
Celica, a woman with child.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:54.940
Celica heard the rumor

00:05:54.940 --> 00:06:00.040
that by drinking the water of the 
underground lake where the Maka resides,

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.130
one can live for 1000 years.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:07.050
But that is surely nothing but a fairy 
tale born from famished hearts...

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:11.530
But the greedy Celica, with 
her lust for long life,

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.850
believed that the rumor was true.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:21.020
She set foot inside the holy cave 
into which no person should ever tread!

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:26.800
As the warmth of the land began to return 
and people started to feel some relief,

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.360
Celica returned to the town.

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:35.610
She spoke with no one, and to everyone's 
surprise, survived for months without eating.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:39.010
She gave birth, then quickly died.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.790
It was then...

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:45.670
Anyone who had witnessed it would know 
what it means for a human to be cursed...

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:51.930
Celica's sinful heart had 
given birth to twins...

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:57.930
Fashioned after the Maka, they had golden 
hair, sea-blue eyes, and claws for hands.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.880
And then, those children...

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:05.370
They say that one day the cursed babies

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:08.910
suddenly disappeared from the 
town, never to appear again.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:13.780
We wish to return to a peaceful 
life together with the Maka!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:19.250
Every day we're working hard to become a 
righteous people that the Maka will accept!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.680
The curse may have been 
brought upon ourselves,

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:26.480
but do not forget that in this land,
the Maka is god, Mr. Seeing!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.630
Cursed?

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:32.130
Anyway, please rest easy tonight.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:40.240
Was Niche really born 200 years ago?

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:46.240
If she really is cursed...

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:51.210
If saying goodbye is so sad for 
you, then I'll stay by your side.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.290
What am I worrying so much about?

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.100
Niche is my precious friend!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:01.860
Of course Niche isn't some cursed child!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:02.660
Lag!

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.870
Should we go investigate?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.340
The cabe!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.990
Do you remember this town, Niche?

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.970
I was just a babe...

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.790
But I have a bad feeling, kind of.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.040
I'm sorry about this, Niche.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:22.710
I took you here not knowing anything...

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:23.660
I'm fine!

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:30.020
I am your dingo, Lag! Anywhere 
you go, I will go with you!

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:36.200
Lag...

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.950
Thank you, Niche...

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:42.060
Let's go. Together.

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.550
Let's go... To the Maka's cave!

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.040
Those kids...

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.050
It couldn't be...

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:55.320
Something really big was dragged here...

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:59.290
Something is definitely 
here. Let's go, Niche!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:04.810
This mist is really dense...

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:06.890
I can barely see my own nose...

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:09.660
It's a tunnel of ice.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:16.570
A gaichuu?

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.450
T-This is...

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:26.960
G-Gaichuu frozen in ice?

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:27.970
Lag!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.630
The biggest, widest pillar is split open?

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:37.220
And there are shindanjuu 
cartridges here as well...

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.070
They don't look exactly like 
the usual gaichuu.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:46.680
But the ones here and that one near 
Moosehead are definitely gaichuu.

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:50.230
Did Gauche lure that one from here?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:56.730
That's right! You can't defeat a gaichuu 
unless you resonate "heart" within them.

00:09:56.730 --> 00:10:00.720
These gaichuu are frozen, but still alive.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.550
Niche!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.790
An underground lake...

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:24.030
T-Then this is Blue Notes Scale 
that the Mayor was talking about.

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:25.510
Where the Maka resides...

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:39.570
That's the... Maka!

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:51.130
Niche! I don't know what kind 
of creature it is, so stay back!

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.870
This is ancamen... uncommon...

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.050
A visitor?

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.960
Is has been near two hunded years!

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.060
Sister.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.640
Two hundred years?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:19.150
Then you're Niche's older sister?

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.000
Those children went into this cave?

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.470
The girl's sea-blue eyes, that golden hair...

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:28.430
That dingo girl must be the Child of Maka!

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:31.490
It's only natural she would go see the Maka.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:33.350
The mist! This proves it!

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:37.900
It's usually so dense we're forced to turn 
back, but now it's so clear, it's scary!

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.970
Inviting the Child of Maka inside!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.840
U-Uh... Nice to meet you!

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:47.520
My name is Lag Seeing!

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:50.790
Niche, your little sister, is my friend!

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:53.610
And my dingo... Er... Co-worker!

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:57.650
So... Um... Could you... Uh...

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:04.840
Excuse me, but... Could you first... Um...

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.910
Please put on underwear!

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.600
"Button underwear"?

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.480
"Put on"!

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:19.170
And if you... Um, if you don't mind, 
covering your chest too, it might...

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:23.590
It looks like Niche is a 
bit fixated on them, too...

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:38.780
Thank you very much! That's 
really a great help!

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:43.210
Niche... If that... Is that 
your name now, Sister?

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:47.640
And also, what is with your body?

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:50.720
You are far too immature and stunted.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:54.500
You have completely forgotten 
to grow, Sister of mine.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.120
I'm not your sister!

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.950
I don't know who you are!

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:00.040
And I'm gonna grow in lots and lots!

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.600
Grow in?

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:03.930
You remember nothing, do you?

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.060
Perhaps you forgot.

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:08.850
What the humans did to us.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:18.630
The Maka does not sense any humans here.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.440
I concur.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.100
You there.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:28.950
Are you a human? Or are you something 
that has taken human form?

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:32.780
Which is it? Shall I slice 
you open to find out?

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:39.200
Niche!

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.760
You may be dinky, but you 
can use your swords, I see.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:52.080
I will beat anyone who hurts Lag!

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.650
As his dingo!

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:54.880
Dingo?

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.700
The Maka... Is it the Maka?

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:01.110
Mr. Mayor?

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:06.070
Maka... What a heavenly body!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.570
To think we could have the 
honor of meeting so close!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:11.800
We are people who live 
in the Glacial Village.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:14.640
If I may introduce myself, I am the Mayor...

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.380
Begone!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.380
I do not recall inviting you here.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.330
Leave here, humans.

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:23.780
Who are you?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.730
I was speaking with the Maka!

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:29.330
Mayor... What if that is 
also the Child of Maka...

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.350
What? But they were twins...

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:35.840
The Maka has long since lost the 
ability to converse with humans.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.990
Then, please tell the Maka this:

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:41.790
In order for us to become 
recognized as righteous people,

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:44.280
we have worked hard for many generations!

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:45.410
Hey, let me...

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:48.610
We've become people worthy of 
living together with the Maka!

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.410
Please, do not misunderstand us!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.520
We aren't like the people from the past!

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:56.520
We don't have the polluted 
heart of a sinner like Celica!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:59.620
Hey, you don't need to go 
mentioning that right...

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.350
It seems you know nothing.

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:03.670
Except for that one.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:09.340
The Maka does nothing but protect this land.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.180
It never had any interest 
in humans from the start.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:17.920
But to hear you speak of what is righteous 
and what is sinful is laughable.

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:20.990
Perhaps I will tell you a little story.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:26.550
What are you doing?

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:30.440
This is the water that'll let 
you live for 1000 years, right?

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:32.740
You idiot! We were just telling the Maka...

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.120
M-Me too...

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.450
What are you doing? Stop it!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.590
Just a little...

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:40.630
The Maka has no interest in 
people, nor any expectations.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:45.970
But there was one lone time when it 
was touched by the heart of a human.

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:50.840
200 years ago, when the heat 
of the land started to subside.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.700
On a grand scale, but quietly,

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:58.130
the Spirit Amber from which the warmth 
of the land grew began being mined.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:03.640
Thanks to the loss of the Spirit Amber, a 
great number of people in the village died.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:08.770
But the Maka, with its own role 
to play, merely watched quietly.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:11.170
Then one day, a wounded woman,

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:16.700
so frail it seemed like she could fall 
at any time, appeared in the cave.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:20.110
Leave, human.

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:21.290
Leave here.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:23.370
I cannot.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.260
For I have come here to die.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.810
Please, devour me, or what have you.

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:33.760
If I return to the village, the people 
there will even kill the child in my belly.

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:36.890
What whimsy was this?

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.440
The Maka turned ear to the person's story.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:44.720
They thought to sacrifice me 
to the guardian of the land,

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:46.670
so the warmth will return to the soil...

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:49.770
With no relatives in the 
village, I was chosen.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:54.510
I begged them to wait 
until I had given birth,

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:56.110
but they refused to listen.

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:58.610
I tried to run away,

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:02.790
but a great many beat me 
and cast me in this place.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:06.250
My husband starved to death.

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:08.720
And I will follow soon.

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:11.920
Great Maka, I beg you.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:17.430
While I am still alive, take my life.

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:20.760
And in return, save my child!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:25.430
All I wish... Is for my child to live on...

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:29.620
As the woman begged, struggling to breathe...

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:33.760
The Maka was touched by a human's 
heart for the first time.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:38.590
And then, a single tear was shed.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:45.920
Human. I have received your heart.

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:48.840
Your wish will soon be granted.

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.660
Eventually Celica returned to the village.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:57.630
It's Celica!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:58.660
Celica!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:02.400
And she gave birth.

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.810
Call the chief!

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.930
Curse... They're cursed!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.850
They aren't even letting out a single cry...

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.920
How frightening!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.720
And, Celica?

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:14.070
It was soon after she gave birth to these...

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.820
I see. That's a small blessing, at least.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.290
Why are they still babies?

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:22.900
20 years passed, and the Maka never appeared.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.470
What did Celica do in that cave?

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:24.840
She must have done something 
to anger the Maka.

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:27.590
The babies were only given water.

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:29.970
And yet they lived on.

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:35.390
Chief! The village to the east has gotten 
wind of the cursed Children of Maka!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:39.680
We can't let Blue Notes Blues 
be tarred by this sin any more!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.730
Chief, make your decision!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:16.500
The unpleasantness is now frozen in the lake!

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:20.010
Future generations will surely 
laud our great actions!

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:41.150
Next: 200 Years of Solitude
